// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
//mangshe.c
inherit NPC;
void create()
{
	set_name("蟒蛇", ({ "mang she", "she" }) );
	set("race", "野兽");
	set("age", 5);
	set("long", "一只昂首直立，吐着长舌芯的大蟒蛇。\n");
	set("attitude", "peaceful");
	set("no_die",1);
	set("str", 26);
	set("cor", 30);
	set("limbs", ({ "头部", "身体", "七寸", "尾巴" }) );
	set("verbs", ({ "bite" }) );
	set("combat_exp", 5000);
        set("chat_chance",50);
	set("chat_msg", ({
		"大蟒蛇虎视眈眈地注视着你，想把你一口吞下！\n",
		"大蟒蛇张了一下血盆大口，好象饿了。\n"
	}) );
	set_temp("apply/attack", 25);
	set_temp("apply/damage", 20);
	set_temp("apply/armor", 18);
	set_temp("apply/defence",20);
	setup();
}
void die()
{
	object ob;
	message_vision("$N倒在地上，死了！\n", this_object());
	ob = new("/d/baituo/obj/shepi");
	ob->move(environment(this_object()));
	destruct(this_object());
}
